<p>NOTE: Total debt (A) Reflects the previously disclosed sale of the Company's Specialty Chemicals division on May 26, 1995.</p>
<p>In 1996, the company incurred an extraordinary charge on the early extinguishment of debt of $532,000 after taxes or $0.07 per share as the result of the refinancing of existing debt at the time of the GOLD BOND acquisition. In 1995, the company recognized net income from discontinued operations and a gain on disposal of its Chattem Chemicals division of $674,000, or $0.09 per share, and $9,334,000, or $1.28 per share, respectively. Also, an extraordinary charge on the early extinguishment of debt of $367,000, or $0.05 per share, was recognized as the result of a prepayment of debt from the proceeds of the divestiture.</p>
